<title>JAPAN: Chichibu Onoda -96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Chichibu Onoda -96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		517.72		vs	  486.99</p>
<p> Operating	   24.65		vs	   11.95</p>
<p> Current	     16.32		vs	    5.94</p>
<p> Net		    9.72		vs	  820    million</p>
<p> EPS		   16.84 yen	  vs	    1.42 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	 16.83 yen	  vs		 -</p>
<p>NOTE - Chichibu Onoda Cement Corp was formed on October 1, 1994 from a merger of Onoda Cement  Co Ltd and Chichibu Cement Co Ltd.</p>
